      "height": 35.38,
      "fontSize": 29,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Curated plan-implement workflow — verified plan bytes, one writer per step, independent checks and report",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 26,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Curated plan-implement workflow — verified plan bytes, one writer per step, independent checks and report",
      "lineHeight": 1.22
    },
    {
      "id": "PotGniBQx7s5gepkdbYp",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1944101413,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1875469441,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785165622101,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 61,
      "width": 3220,
      "height": 18.3,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "The host binds one digest-verified plan.md separately from semantic text, and the entry proves those exact bytes were a successful plan run’s terminal result. Deterministic code parses the S<n> blocks; a shaped no-tool selector chooses which of them this run implements, the plan’s own order is restored, and one writer owns each step before independent checks and a fresh report.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The host binds one digest-verified plan.md separately from semantic text, and the entry proves those exact bytes were a successful plan run’s terminal result. Deterministic code parses the S<n> blocks; a shaped no-tool selector chooses which of them this run implements, the plan’s own order is restored, and one writer owns each step before independent checks and a fresh report.",
      "lineHeight": 1.22
    },
